{"articleNo":"158750","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=158750&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"복수전공, 부전공, 연계전공 이수예정자 졸업예정증명서 제출시 유의사항","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.09.26","hit":"4772","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong><u></u></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">복수전공, 부전공, 연계전공 이수예정자 <font color=\"#670000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">졸업예정증명서</span></font> 제출시 유의사항</span></u></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">복수전공,부전공,연계전공 이수예정자가 <strong>졸업예정증명서</strong>를 발급(2016.9.27.부터 발급가능)시</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>복수전공,부전공,연계전공자로 표기되어 발급</strong>되며,</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">추후 이수포기신청기간</span>[2016.11.22.(화)~11.24.(목)]에 <strong>이수포기하여 확정처리되면</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>복수전공,부전공,연계전공 내역이 삭제되어 발급</strong>됩니다.</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">이수포기 전에 졸업예정증명서를 발급받아 채용지원 서류를 제출하는 학생은</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">졸업예정증명서를 타기관에 제출시 </span></strong>다음과 같은 사항이 발생하지 않도록 유의바라며,</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">타기관에 포기신청 예정이라는 사실을 미리 알리고, 포기예정이라는 서류를 함께 제출하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></span></u></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--></font></p><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 715.08pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #e5e5e5; HEIGHT: 111.9pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">※ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">유의사항</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">타기관 채용지원 서류에 복수전공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">부전공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">연계전공 이수예정이라는 졸업예정증명서를 제출하여 합격을 생각하고 있었으나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">추후 입사 후 이수내역이 없는 것을 확인하여 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">처음에 제출한 졸업예정증명서와 </span></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">입사 후 졸업증명서의 내용이 상이하므로<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 허위서류 제출로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 판단</span></span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">되어 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">채용합격을 취소</span>하는 상황이 발생할 수도 있음</span></u></font></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
